WEBVTT

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.130
The beach!

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.710
The night before!

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.840
You're really excited about it, huh?

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.430
Hana, are you okay?

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.970
You look like you're brooding
about something.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:18.970
Really?

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:20.140
Is it that?

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.520
You're scared because you can't swim?

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.480
It'll be fine, Hana!

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.070
We can play tag on the beach
and write "love" in the sand,

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.490
only to see it get washed away by a wave!

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.030
Y-Yeah.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.860
Um, but that's not what it was about.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.490
When I think that I'm going to
wear a bikini tomorrow

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:41.040
and have my belly button exposed,
it makes me so nervous!

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.120
Don't worry.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:47.710
Baring it all like that will let everyone
see that you have a nice body.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.010
By that logic,
wouldn't it be best to go naked?

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.260
No!

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.090
Let's show our belly buttons tomorrow.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.510
O-Okay!

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:00.220
Now, let's get some sleep.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:02.020
We're leaving early tomorrow.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.520
Okay!

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:06.150
Eiko...

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:08.980
When we get to the beach,

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:16.110
can I rub a bunch of that white,
gooey liquid all over your body?

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:17.280
Go to sleep.

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:18.700
Okay!

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:54.550
GORILLA IN A SWIMSUIT

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.180
Huh?

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:03.390
On TV, they said
it was gonna be a sunny day.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.470
What should we do about the beach?

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:08.440
I don't think we can go like this.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:10.980
Hana!

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.730
I-I was really looking forward to it!

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:18.110
I was even practicing swimming!

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.740
Hana...

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:30.460
Jeez.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:32.210
We're getting a heavy rain in here, too.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.170
Eiko...

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:39.550
T-To be honest, I was looking forward
to wearing a swimsuit, too!

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:41.260
Swimsuit girls!

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:43.850
That's an event still shot!

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:45.220
Hana, Tama...

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.640
Ta-da!

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:56.440
Wh-What are you two doing?

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:58.030
Even if we can't go to the beach,

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.740
we can at least feel
a little refreshed this way, right?

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:08.200
Bam!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:12.370
This is a surprise!

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.500
I didn't figure we'd go
the swimsuits-in-the-room route!

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.630
Route?

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:18.130
And even better,

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.420
there's the bikini string collection event!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:25.300
Gotcha!

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.310
Okay, give it back.

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.980
Even if this is a censored illustration,
it still pisses me off!

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:37.070
Illustration?

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:41.530
So what should we do?

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.280
What should we do?
What should we do?

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.240
Since we're wearing
the swimsuits already...

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:50.290
There was something I didn't get
on our homework handout,

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.250
so explain it to me, Hana.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:53.750
Which one?

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:58.250
Why in the world
did you bring your homework here?

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:01.720
Well, I thought I'd ask her
if I got the chance.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:03.680
So this one...

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:05.140
You're a lifesaver!

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:08.970
Why do you give in to her so easily, Hana?

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.980
Girls in swimsuits studying...

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:17.730
Not bad. Not bad at all!

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.190
Tama, you're too noisy.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.230
Huh?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.190
Kamu, what's in the box?

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:24.860
Apple pie.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:28.120
I thought we could eat it
on the train, but...

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.910
Apple pie? I want some!

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.330
If we eat it here, I want to heat it up.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.290
It's much better heated up!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.210
Then why don't we warm it up
and have some tea, too?

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:41.550
I'll watch you heat it.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.470
My microwave spins.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.300
Eiko!

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:48.640
Hana's...

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:51.430
Um... Her chest...

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.100
Has it gotten a little bigger lately?

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.690
Well, she is growing up.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.360
The chest... develops?

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.940
Th-Then it's not just an urban legend?

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.440
FIRST-YEAR MATH
Practice Questions

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:07.280
I guess genetics have a lot
to do with it, too.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:11.530
Hana's cousin is super-stacked.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:12.990
Super-stacked?

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:16.620
In fact, Kamu's got her share, too,
doesn't she?

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.080
Yes, I suppose she does.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.920
W-Well, we're not done
growing yet either,

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.720
so there's nothing to worry about, right?

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:33.430
They say if you touch this
and it hurts, you're still growing.

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:40.940
FLAT

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.440
PAT PAT

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:43.940
WHAP WHAP

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:54.200
BAM BAM

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.450
Well, it's not like a gorilla
drumming its chest.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:49.700
That's rude!

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:52.700
A gorilla doesn't drum
with its fists, but open palms!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:00.330
Please apologize!
Apologize to the gorilla!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:02.840
BAM BAM

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.170
S-Sorry, Ms. Gorilla.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.960
I don't forgive you!

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:06.970
Wh-What was that about?

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.090
Drumming...

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:11.010
Drumming is with your open palms,
not fists!

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.390
Apologize!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.180
Sorry, Gorilla.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:15.930
Don't worry about it.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:18.060
So did your chest hurt?

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:21.100
No, only my pride...

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.230
I've got it!

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:27.030
It's like a muscle ache where you don't
feel pain until days afterward!

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:31.070
Tama, I think that's more a sign
of aging, not growing.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:34.530
What's wrong?

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.040
How's this?

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.040
Feels like you're getting hugged
from behind by a boy, doesn't it?

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.670
Are boys this squishy?

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.180
It's from Mom.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.800
"Here's some delicious lychee. Eat up!"

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:58.060
There's too much here!

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:04.020
Hana's always helping me out,
so I'll share them with her!

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.150
It still might be too much.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.030
Yes?

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:09.990
Huh?

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.240
I'll be right there!

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.790
Yay!

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.420
Oh, I see. So that's why
you're wearing swimsuits.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:28.550
Yes.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.220
Now that you know the secret
of this apartment,

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.850
we'll make you into a swimsuit girl,
too, Big Sis Hannen!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.730
No, no, see, unfortunately,
I don't even have a swimsuit, so...

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:43.980
Not a problem.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:46.190
I have a spare.

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.240
Um...

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:03.420
Even though you're embarrassed,
your body is in a swimsuit!

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.750
Well, sure.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.840
Her chest is big!

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.880
Th-That's so cool!

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.800
I am embarrassed.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.590
This is the first time
I've ever worn a bikini.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:17.430
What a waste.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.640
You've got a nice body,
so you should wear one more often.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:26.150
Yeah, but I'm really nervous
about the way this bikini was put together.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.900
It only looks like it'll come undone.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:30.280
See?

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.110
Oh, yeah.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:33.860
So that's just a decoration.

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:42.330
That side was a real string
connected to the bottoms.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:46.790
Delicious!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:49.670
Thank you, Hiroe!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.670
No, not at all.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:55.880
My mom sent me a ton,
so I didn't know what to do with it.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.140
A-A ton of lychee?

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.010
Nice mom.

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.520
So there are lychees
that have pink skin, too, huh?

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.940
I only knew about the ones
with brown skin.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.860
Oh, there's just one kind.

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:14.190
When they're fresh, the skin is pink,

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:17.030
but then they become brown
as they lose their freshness.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:20.030
Fresh lychee are yummy.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.040
They're kind of like nipples, right?

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.660
- What?
- What?

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.630
Fresh nipples are yummy.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.340
T-Tama! Kamuri!

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:39.760
She's not picking up.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.980
I thought I heard screaming.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.730
I hope she's okay.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:54.110
Wait!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.910
Sh-Shion! I-I can explain.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:03.830
Oh, it's okay. I get it.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:08.420
Sh-Shion!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:11.330
N-Now that she's seen me
in this immodest attire,

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.710
how can I face her from now on?

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.840
It won't be a problem, Big Sis Hannen!

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.720
If we're talking about being immodest,

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.470
Eiko is much more immodest than you!

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.220
Tama, that's not making her
feel any better.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.020
But after suddenly seeing me in this,

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:31.150
maybe your cousin
will ban me from the building.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:32.730
Wh-Wh-What should we do?

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:35.440
If Shion took it in the wrong, weird way...

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:40.740
Hello again.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.990
Shion?

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:44.830
Y-You stepped outside your apartment
wearing that?

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.250
It's the three-second rule, Hana.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:53.880
I'm Shion Kyouzuka.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.630
Thank you for always
taking good care of Hana.

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.380
I'm Eiko Tokura.

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:02.390
On the contrary,
Hana's been a good friend to me.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:06.220
I-I'm Kamuri Sengoku.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:08.270
Well, you're adorable!

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:09.810
Isn't she, though?

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.560
Are the lychees fresh?

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:14.770
Cut it out.

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:17.730
So is something up, Shion?

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.780
Oh, that's right.

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:22.990
I sent you a mail,
but it looks like you didn't notice.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:27.200
You know, there's a resort hotel
and a hot spring pool not far from here.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.250
Since you've got your swimsuits already,

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.370
why not go swimming—

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:35.460
That's right! We could do that, too!

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.960
Let's go to the pool right now!

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.510
S-Sure! I want to go!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.880
Then should we go now?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:43.550
Yep.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.140
Oh, then I'll hold the fort—

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:49.970
I suppose Ms. Hannen and I will join you.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.560
Don't I get a say?

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:54.560
Let's all go to the pool!

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.870
Wow! What a beautiful pool!

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:07.870
It's like we have it all to ourselves!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:11.710
Yahoo, yahoo, yahoo!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.710
Knock it off. No running!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.960
Bliss... Bliss...

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:20.460
Kamu, you act like you're in a bathtub.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.340
Because my swimsuit is warm.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:27.100
I-If I think of it as a giant bathtub,
then it's not so scary.

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:29.970
That argument doesn't hold much water.

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:32.310
I practiced swimming in my bathtub!

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.690
Then let's see the fruit of your labor!

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:38.230
O-Okay!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:50.700
I-I can stay underwater for ten seconds!

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.250
You sure are making a lot of progress...

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.330
I guess.

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:56.670
That's not swimming.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:00.170
Th-That level is still too high for me.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.590
Well, one step at a time.

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:09.350
M-Massage?

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:12.270
You treated me to sushi for lunch before,

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:13.480
so by way of thanks...

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:17.940
No, no, you're always
helping me out, Landlady,

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:22.360
so I'm the one who owes you thanks,
and anyway, a massage for me is...

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.070
Don't be shy.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.610
It'll make your skin really smooth.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:27.910
Even if it does get really smooth,

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:31.790
the only person who'll see it is the woman
who works at the convenience store.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.460
Kamu, you're good at swimming, huh?

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:43.380
Yep. I like floating in the water.

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:45.800
It feels great, doesn't it?

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:49.390
I like looking at the water's surface
when I'm underwater.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:50.850
I know what you mean.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.810
Oh, now you're able to have
a normal conversation,

00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:00.480
even when Eiko isn't nearby.

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:06.070
Kamu, come back! "Kamu back" to me!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.120
Is this all right?

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:17.500
Is it all right for someone like me
to be treated like a king?

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:20.630
Sure, it's okay.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.550
Sorry about this, Eiko.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:30.510
Helping me... practice...

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.470
Not at all.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:37.100
Don't worry about it.
Just keep your mouth closed.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:43.020
Hana! Eiko!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:46.110
Tama, what is that, the dog paddle?

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:48.860
I'm good at dog paddling!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:52.990
What do you think?

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.740
So stable you could
take me for a dog, right?

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:59.620
First you're a gorilla, now a dog.
You sure are busy.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:02.380
Sometimes I'm a panther, too.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.960
Panther!

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:11.220
When I see Hana and the other girls
getting along so well,

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:15.720
I feel dazzled and just a little sad.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:18.310
Oh, I know what you mean.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:21.270
Makes me think, "I was once like that."

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:25.110
I feel like Hana's been blessed
to have such wonderful friends.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:28.740
And you're one of them, Ms. Hannen.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:31.950
Me, too?

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:34.660
I mean, I'm honored, but...

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:42.920
Well, an adult has adult pleasures, too.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.130
T-True.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:52.050
Hana's wiped out!

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:54.760
That's because she was serious
about practicing.

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:57.430
Nothing's better than sweets
when you're exhausted.

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:00.930
I'll take the sweetest thing
you've got!

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.690
Hey, do you remember this morning?

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:08.690
When I saw Hana crying,
I felt kind of happy.

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:15.200
It made me think that Hana really
enjoys hanging out with us.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.660
Good point!

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.830
And she makes us feel so welcome
when we stay over!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:23.290
I'm welcome to leave sweets there, too.

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:29.670
Come to think of it, wasn't another girl
crying this morning, too?

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:33.050
There, there.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:39.810
Don't try to cheer me up now,
like eight hours later!

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:39.810
That's not drumming.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:48.310
<i>It's too bad that we didn't
